{"id":"54aed6245d096f1e","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Barrier In Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree — ZFC Tree10 Barrier In Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree — ZFC Tree10 Barrier In Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-barrier-in-tree — ZFC Tree10 Barrier In Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dda7c85261e49800\" href=\"?note=dda7c85261e49800\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,T\\in V\">\\(B,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S\\)</span> (front predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierInTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierInTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}barrier\\text{-}in\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierInTree}_S(B,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(B,T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}barrier\\text{-}in\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierInTree}_S(B,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(B,T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For trees of finite sequences, this barrier notion is exactly the canonical\nfront predicate: an antichain meeting every infinite branch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md","status":"resolved","id":"dda7c85261e49800","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierInTree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}barrier\\text{-}in\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierInTree}_S(B,T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(B,T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":928,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f9cd63bebb9fea2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BarrierI